     "\r\n  \r\n\r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\r\n    <div>\r\n      <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Dear breedRs,</p>\r\n      <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">I have just made a\r\n        major <a href=\"https://github.com/famuvie/breedR/releases/tag/v0.11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/famuvie/breedR/releases/tag/v0.11&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244798261000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1n7PXFF0ESrTG7VXeD1EUJ\">release</a>\r\n        of breedR.</p>\r\n      <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Nothing important\r\n        has changed from the latest version 0.10-22.<br>\r\n        I cleaned up several minor bugs and documentation issues.</p>\r\n      <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">This simply closes\r\n        the v0.10 series, where all the high priority issues were\r\n        addressed, like the computation of heritability, and the\r\n        installation process.</p>\r\n      <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">More importantly, it\r\n        start the v0.11 series, where I will start implementing the\r\n        multi-trait support.</p>\r\n      <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Remember that now\r\n        the installation has been greatly simplified, and you can update\r\n        breedR as a regular package avoiding the heavy devtools. For\r\n        that you only need to add the new breedR repository to your list\r\n        of package repositories (check getOption(“repos”)). Follow the\r\n        instructions on the breedR <a href=\"http://famuvie.github.io/breedR/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://famuvie.github.io/breedR/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244798261000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2pkAOEmMAnVVtVj3CZAPNW\">site</a>.</p>\r\n      <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Have a good weekend<br>\r\n        ƒacu.-</p>\r\n      <div title=\"MDH:RGVhciBicmVlZFJzLDxicj48YnI+SSBoYXZlIGp1c3QgbWFkZSBhIG1ham9yIFtyZWxlYXNlXShodHRwczovL2dpdGh1Yi5jb20vZmFtdXZpZS9icmVlZFIvcmVsZWFzZXMvdGFnL3YwLjExKSBvZiBi\r\ncmVlZFIuPGJyPjxicj5Ob3RoaW5nIGltcG9ydGFudCBoYXMgY2hhbmdlZCBmcm9tIHRoZSBsYXRl\r\nc3QgdmVyc2lvbiAwLjEwLTIyLiA8YnI+SSBjbGVhbmVkIHVwIHNldmVyYWwgbWlub3IgYnVncyBh\r\nbmQgZG9jdW1lbnRhdGlvbiBpc3N1ZXMuPGJyPjxicj5UaGlzIHNpbXBseSBjbG9zZXMgdGhlIHYw\r\nLjEwIHNlcmllcywgd2hlcmUgYWxsIHRoZSBoaWdoIHByaW9yaXR5IGlzc3VlcyB3ZXJlIGFkZHJl\r\nc3NlZCwgbGlrZSB0aGUgY29tcHV0YXRpb24gb2YgaGVyaXRhYmlsaXR5LCBhbmQgdGhlIGluc3Rh\r\nbGxhdGlvbiBwcm9jZXNzLjxicj48YnI+TW9yZSBpbXBvcnRhbnRseSwgaXQgc3RhcnQgdGhlIHYw\r\nLjExIHNlcmllcywgd2hlcmUgSSB3aWxsIHN0YXJ0IGltcGxlbWVudGluZyB0aGUgbXVsdGktdHJh\r\naXQgc3VwcG9ydC48YnI+PGJyPlJlbWVtYmVyIHRoYXQgbm93IHRoZSBpbnN0YWxsYXRpb24gaGFz\r\nIGJlZW4gZ3JlYXRseSBzaW1wbGlmaWVkLCBhbmQgeW91IGNhbiB1cGRhdGUgYnJlZWRSIGFzIGEg\r\ncmVndWxhciBwYWNrYWdlIGF2b2lkaW5nIHRoZSBoZWF2eSBkZXZ0b29scy4gRm9yIHRoYXQgeW91\r\nIG9ubHkgbmVlZCB0byBhZGQgdGhlIG5ldyBicmVlZFIgcmVwb3NpdG9yeSB0byB5b3VyIGxpc3Qg\r\nb2YgcGFja2FnZSByZXBvc2l0b3JpZXMgKGNoZWNrIGdldE9wdGlvbigicmVwb3MiKSkuIEZvbGxv\r\ndyB0aGUgaW5zdHJ1Y3Rpb25zIG9uIHRoZSBicmVlZFIgW3NpdGVdKGh0dHA6Ly9mYW11dmllLmdp\r\ndGh1Yi5pby9icmVlZFIvKS48YnI+PGJyPkhhdmUgYSBnb29kIHdlZWtlbmQ8YnI+wqDCoMKgIMKg\r\n        wqDCoCDGkmFjdS4tPGJyPjxicj4=\" style=\"min-height:0;width:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0;margin:0\">​</div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n"
